Text_en:
An indifferent servant is not a pious servant.
Gaza has nothing to do with me;
Syria, which has nothing to do with me;
Lebanon has nothing to do with me;
Nigeria has nothing to do with me;
It has nothing to do with me at all;
I am only looking for Imam Zaman (AS).

#Quds_Day
#Gaza

They asked Imam Sadiq (a.s.) about verse 4 of Surah Isra, which says that the Israelites will corrupt the earth twice; 
The Prophet said that the first one was the martyrdom of Ali bin Abi Talib (a.s.).
(Bihar al-Anwar, vol. 53)

The mocking line of this enemy attack is completely wrong; Even if the enemy has fired a bullet at Iran, he must sit down.
Now that it claims to target several points;
The attack on Iran's holy land must be answered vigorously.

Imam Ali (a.s.)
 A noble person, no matter how great he reaches, does not get drunk; Like a mountain that no wind shakes;
 But #Forumayeh becomes intoxicated by reaching the lowest position; Like a grass plant that is moved by the breeze.
